   "html_text": "The lively and wide-ranging debate on v-Curry paradoxes has resulted in genuine progress in our understanding of Curry paradoxes. Nonetheless, while v-Curry paradoxes may invite different resolutions from non-v-Curry paradoxes, they typically remain within the same mold as generalized Curry paradoxes. In particular, in the general template of section 5.2 one may take ⟦M⟧ to express (either as a predicate or as a connective) consequence in light of ⟦M⟧ itself. This is the heart of v-Curry. Inasmu",
   "md_text": "The lively and wide-ranging debate on v-Curry paradoxes has resulted in genuine progress in our understanding of Curry paradoxes. Nonetheless, while v-Curry paradoxes may invite different resolutions from non-v-Curry paradoxes, they typically remain within the same mold as generalized Curry paradoxes. In particular, in the general template of section 5.2 one may take ⟦M⟧ to express (either as a predicate or as a connective) consequence in light of ⟦M⟧ itself. This is the heart of v-Curry. Inasmu"
